    "chunk_text": "On anre nihte ealdne monan, swahw\u00e6tswa \u00fee m\u00e6te\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t cym\u00f0 to gefean. On tweigra nihta monan & on \u00fereora, n\u00e6f\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t swefen n\u00e6nige fremednesse godes ne yfeles. On feowernihtne & on fifa, \u00fe\u00e6t by\u00fe god swefen, wite \u00feu, \u00fe\u00e6t georne on \u00feinre heortan. On syx nihta, \u00fe\u00e6t\u00fee \u00feonne \u00feince, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu geseo, \u00fe\u00e6t beo f\u00e6st on \u00feinum breostum, wite, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fein ge\u00feanc On vii nihta, swahw\u00e6tswa \u00fee on eage byre\u00fe, \u00e6fter tide cym\u00f0 seo endung. On viii nihte & on ix, sona \u00fe\u00e6t ype\u00f0, swahw\u00e6tswa \u00fee geswefna\u00fe, gif \u00feu unrotnesse gesawe, wend \u00fein On x nihta \u00fein swefen ag\u00e6\u00fe butan frecnesse. On xi nihta \u00fe\u00e6t swefen ag\u00e6\u00fe mid gefean. On xii & on xiii nihta binnan \u00ferim nihton \u00feu gesyhst, \u00fe\u00e6t\u00fee \u00e6r on swefne \u00e6tywede. On xiiii nihta, n\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6nige fremednesse godes ne yfeles. On xv nihta, sceortwyrplic \u00fe\u00e6t by\u00fe. On xvi nihta \u00e6fter langre tide hit ag\u00e6\u00f0. On xvii & on xviii & on xix nihta, \u00fe\u00e6t swefen by\u00fe go & on manegum dagum geenda\u00f0. On xx nihta & on xxi \u00fe\u00e6t tacna\u00fe ceapunga & hwearfunga. On xxii & on xxiii nihta, seo m\u00e6ting by\u00fe gecornes & geflites & eall costnunge full,",
